<span class="sh-syn-tags">
<span class="sh-syn-tag">MAGNESIUM SULFATE</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Magnesium sulfate anhydrous</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">MgSO4</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Magnesiumsulfat</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Sal Angalis</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Sal De sedlitz</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Tomix OT</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Sulfuric acid magnesium salt</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Magnesium(II) sulfate</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Magnesium sulfate,anhydrous</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Magnesium sulphate anhydrous</span><span class="sh-syn-tag">Magnesium sulphate, anhydrous</span>        </span></div></div></section><div class="sh-content"><div class="pd-wrap"><h2>Description</h2><p>magnesium sulphate anhydrous · CAS <span dir="ltr" style="white-space:nowrap;unicode-bidi:isolate;">139939-75-6</span> · MgSO4. UNII ML30MJ2U7I. Melting Point: 1124; Melting Point: Decomposes @ 1124 °C; Melting Point: 1127 °C.</p><h2>Identification</h2><table class="pd-spec"><tbody><tr><th>CAS Registry Number</th><td><span dir="ltr" style="white-space:nowrap;unicode-bidi:isolate;">139939-75-6</span></td></tr><tr><th>PubChem CID</th><td>24083</td></tr><tr><th>Molecular formula</th><td>MgSO4</td></tr><tr><th>IUPAC name</th><td>magnesium sulfate</td></tr><tr><th>UNII (FDA)</th><td>ML30MJ2U7I</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Computed Descriptors</h2><table class="pd-spec"><tbody><tr><th>Molecular Weight</th><td>120.37</td></tr><tr><th>Hydrogen Bond Donor Count</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Hydrogen Bond Acceptor Count</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Rotatable Bond Count</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Exact Mass</th><td>119.9367713</td></tr><tr><th>Monoisotopic Mass</th><td>119.9367713</td></tr><tr><th>Topological Polar Surface Area</th><td>88.6</td></tr><tr><th>Heavy Atom Count</th><td>6</td></tr><tr><th>Formal Charge</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Complexity</th><td>62.2</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Physical &amp; Chemical Properties</h2><table class="pd-spec"><tbody><tr><th>Melting Point</th><td>1124</td></tr><tr><th>Melting Point</th><td>Decomposes @ 1124 °C</td></tr><tr><th>Melting Point</th><td>1127 °C</td></tr><tr><th>Solubility</th><td>710</td></tr><tr><th>Solubility</th><td>In water, 360 g/l @ 20 °C</td></tr><tr><th>Density</th><td>2.66 g/cu cm</td></tr><tr><th>Density</th><td>2.66 g/cm³</td></tr><tr><th>Density</th><td>2.66 @25 °C</td></tr><tr><th>LogP</th><td>-0.91</td></tr><tr><th>Decomposition</th><td>1124 °C</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Physical description &amp; handling notes</h2><ul class="pd-app"><li>Dry Powder; Large Crystals; Liquid; Other Solid; Liquid; Other Solid; Dry Powder; CBI; Large Crystals</li><li>White solid with a bitter, saline taste; [ICSC]</li><li>HYGROSCOPIC ODOURLESS WHITE CRYSTALS OR POWDER.</li><li>Colorless crystalline solid</li><li>Orthorhombic crystals</li><li>Opaque powder</li></ul><h2>Regulatory Status</h2><table class="pd-spec"><tbody><tr><th>Regulatory &amp; Food Contact</th><td>NUTRIENT_SUPPLEMENT: Food Additives<br />NOT SPECIFIED<br />TRS 947-JECFA68/<br />FAS 59-JECFA68/<br />CIR / INCI: Cosmetic ingredients (Magnesium Sulfate) -&gt; CIR (Cosmetic Ingredient Review)<br />CIR / INCI: Bulking; Hair conditioning; Viscosity controlling</td></tr><tr><th>GHS notification summary</th><td>41.4% (1034 / 2499)</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>GHS Hazard Classification</h2><table class="pd-spec"><tbody><tr><th>GHS notification summary</th><td>41.4% (1034 / 2499)</td></tr><tr><th>Reported hazard statements</th><td>H302 (57.2%), H312 (51.5%), H332 (57.1%)</td></tr></tbody></table><div lang="en"><p>This chemical does not meet GHS hazard criteria for 41.4% (1034 of 2499) of reports.</p><p>H302 (57.2%): Harmful if swallowed [Warning Acute toxicity, oral]</p></div><h2>Documented Uses</h2><ul class="pd-app"><li>CIR ingredient: Magnesium Sulfate</li><li>Used to weight cotton and silk, augment bleaching of chlorinated lime, tan leather, fireproof fabrics, dye and print fabrics, and to manufacture fertilizers, mineral water, explosives, and matches; Used therapeutically; [Merck Index]</li><li>Textiles (Fiber &amp; Fabric Manufacturing) [Category: Industry]</li><li>Leather Tanning and Processing [Category: Industry]</li><li>Textiles (Printing, Dyeing, or Finishing) [Category: Industry]</li><li>WEIGHTING COTTON AND SILK; INCR BLEACHING ACTION OF CHLORINATED LIME; MFR OF MOTHER-OF-PEARL AND FROSTED PAPERS; FIRE-PROOFING FABRICS; DYEING &amp; PRINTING CALICOS; IN FERTILIZERS; EXPLOSIVES, MATCHES; MINERAL WATER; TANNING LEATHER.</li></ul><h2>Synonyms</h2><p>MAGNESIUM SULFATE; <span dir="ltr" style="white-space:nowrap;unicode-bidi:isolate;">7487-88-9</span>; Magnesium sulfate anhydrous; MgSO4; Sulfuric acid magnesium salt (1:1); Magnesiumsulfat; Magnesium sulfate (1:1); Sal Angalis; Sal De sedlitz; Tomix OT; Sulfuric acid magnesium salt; Magnesium(II) sulfate; Magnesium sulfate,anhydrous; Magnesium sulphate anhydrous; ML30MJ2U7I; Magnesium sulphate, anhydrous</p><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>What are the CAS number and molecular formula of magnesium sulphate anhydrous?</h3><p>CAS <span dir="ltr" style="white-space:nowrap;unicode-bidi:isolate;">139939-75-6</span>; molecular formula MgSO4; molecular weight — g/mol.</p><h3>What other names is magnesium sulphate anhydrous known by?</h3><p>MAGNESIUM SULFATE, <span dir="ltr" style="white-space:nowrap;unicode-bidi:isolate;">7487-88-9</span>, Magnesium sulfate anhydrous, MgSO4, Sulfuric acid magnesium salt (1:1), Magnesiumsulfat.</p><h3>What is the regulatory status of magnesium sulphate anhydrous?</h3><p>Documented regulatory listings: NUTRIENT_SUPPLEMENT: Food Additives; NOT SPECIFIED; TRS 947-JECFA68/.</p><h3>Is magnesium sulphate anhydrous classified as hazardous?</h3><p>41.4% of GHS notifications report no hazard classification (1034 of 2499).</p><h3>What are the key physical properties of magnesium sulphate anhydrous?</h3><p>Melting Point: 1124; Melting Point: Decomposes @ 1124 °C; Melting Point: 1127 °C; Solubility: 710.</p><p class="pd-src">Facts on this page are taken from PubChem (US National Library of Medicine) and Wikidata. Grade-specific data — assay, moisture, particle size, packaging, shelf life — is issued per batch on the COA and is not published here.</p><p><a class="pd-btn" href="mailto:sales@shenghechemical.com?subject=Inquiry%3A%20magnesium-sulphate-anhydrous">Email us for price, COA and specification</a></p></div></div><div class="sh-extra"><section class="sh-block"><h2>Packaging &amp; Shipping</h2><ul class="sh-list"><li><b>Standard:</b> 25 kg fiber drum / 200 kg steel drum with double PE liner</li><li><b>Small pack:</b> 1 kg / 5 kg aluminum foil bag for lab &amp; sample</li><li><b>Custom:</b> packaging size and labeling per customer requirement</li><li><b>Lead time:</b> in-stock items ship within 3-5 business days</li><li><b>Documents:</b> COA, MSDS / SDS, TDS provided with every shipment</li><li><b>Global:</b> air, sea (FCL / LCL) and express to 80+ countries</li></ul></section><section class="sh-block"><h2>Storage &amp; Handling</h2><p>Store in a cool, dry, well-ventilated place away from heat, direct sunlight and incompatible materials. Keep container tightly closed. Use appropriate personal protective equipment and refer to the SDS for full safety guidance before handling.</p></section><section class="sh-block sh-faq"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="sh-faq-item"><div class="sh-faq-q">Can you provide a Certificate of Analysis (COA) and sample?</div><p class="sh-faq-a">Yes. A batch-specific COA and free or charged sample are available on request before bulk ordering.</p></div><div class="sh-faq-item"><div class="sh-faq-q">Do you support custom synthesis or specific specifications?</div><p class="sh-faq-a">Yes. We offer custom grade, particle size and purity adjustment based on your application and order volume.</p></div><div class="sh-faq-item"><div class="sh-faq-q">What are your minimum order quantities (MOQ)?</div><p class="sh-faq-a">MOQ depends on the product; small quantities are supported for R&amp;D and trial runs.</p></div><div class="sh-faq-item"><div class="sh-faq-q">How do you ensure consistent quality?</div><p class="sh-faq-a">Every batch is tested in-house and retains full traceability from raw material to finished goods.</p></div></section><section class="sh-block"><h2>Why Choose Jinan Shenghe Chemical</h2><div class="sh-why-grid"><div class="sh-why-card"><div class="n">13+</div><div class="t">Years of Export</div><div class="d">Serving global B2B buyers across the chemical industry since 2013.</div></div><div class="sh-why-card"><div class="n">Full Range</div><div class="t">Products in Catalog</div><div class="d">Broad coverage of fine chemicals, additives and intermediates.</div></div><div class="sh-why-card"><div class="n">80+</div><div class="t">Countries Served</div><div class="d">Reliable long-term supply with worldwide logistics.</div></div><div class="sh-why-card"><div class="n">100%</div><div class="t">Batch Tested</div><div class="d">COA and traceability for every shipment.</div></div></div></section><section class="sh-contact"><h2>Request a Quote</h2><p>Looking for pricing, availability or technical data for <b>magnesium sulphate anhydrous</b>?</p><p>Email us at <span class="em">sales@shenghechemical.com</span> or use the button above. Our team typically responds within 1 business day.</p></section></div><section class="sh-company" style="margin-top: 56px;"><h2>About Jinan Shenghe Chemical Co., Ltd.</h2><div class="sh-company-grid"><div class="sh-company-brand"><div class="logo">SH</div><h3>Jinan Shenghe Chemical Co., Ltd.</h3><p>We are a professional chemical supplier based in Jinan, China. Since 2013, we have been connecting manufacturers and global B2B buyers with reliable sourcing, quality-controlled products and efficient logistics.</p><p>Our business covers food &amp; feed additives, fine chemicals, pharmaceutical intermediates, eco-materials, coatings and specialty chemicals — all non-hazardous and compliant with our licensed scope.</p></div><div class="sh-company-details"><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Company Name</div><div class="sh-company-dd">Jinan Shenghe Chemical Co., Ltd.</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Business Type</div><div class="sh-company-dd">Manufacturer Representative / Trading Company</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Location</div><div class="sh-company-dd">Jinan, Shandong, China</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Main Products</div><div class="sh-company-dd">Fine Chemicals, Additives, Intermediates</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Export Markets</div><div class="sh-company-dd">Asia, Europe, North &amp; South America, Middle East</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Documents Supplied</div><div class="sh-company-dd">COA, MSDS / SDS, TDS</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Email</div><div class="sh-company-dd">sales@shenghechemical.com</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Phone / WhatsApp</div><div class="sh-company-dd">+86-18553102138</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Tel (Office)</div><div class="sh-company-dd">0531-84992235</div></div><div><div class="sh-company-dt">Website</div><div class="sh-company-dd">www.shenghechemical.com</div></div></div></div></section><section class="sh-rel-section"><h2>Related Products</h2><div class="sh-rel-grid">
